      {
        "id": 14222,
        "title": "Espressioni di stringhe",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Adding string values",
            "id": 126293,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo concatenare valori stringa con il segno <code>+</code>.</p><p>Somma insieme i valori <code>\"Followers:\"</code> e <code>\"55\"</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying expressions",
            "id": 126294,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Chiamiamo <strong>espressione</strong> l'unione di valori stringa perché crea un singolo valore stringa.</p><p>Aggiungi l'espressione tra le parentesi di <code>print()</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Followers:55\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Followers:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>\"55\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Expressions with variables",
            "id": 126295,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando le espressioni contengono variabili, usano i valori presenti nelle variabili.</p><p>Crea un'espressione che sommi il valore <code>\"Followers:\"</code> e la variabile <code>followers</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" followers = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + followers\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"36\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Followers:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e infine <code>followers</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Display expression",
            "id": 126296,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare <code>print()</code> per vedere i risultati delle espressioni in Swift.</p><p>Aggiungi un'istruzione <code>print()</code> attorno all'espressione.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" numberOfFollowers = \" /><text value=\"&quot;55&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Followers:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + numberOfFollowers)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"29\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Followers:55\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>print</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e infine <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Setting the result of an expression",
            "id": 126297,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Poiché le espressioni diventano valori, possiamo assegnarle alle variabili proprio come i valori.</p><p>Salva l'espressione <code>\"Posts:\" + \"13\"</code> nella variabile <code>label</code> e visualizzala nella console.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Posts:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;13&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(label)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"39\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Posts:13\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Posts:\"</code>, seguito da <code>+</code> e poi <code>\"13\"</code>, <code>label</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "The value of label",
            "id": 126298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual è il valore di <code>label</code>?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Name:&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>\"Name:Joe\"</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"Joe\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"Name:Joe\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Displaying nothing",
            "id": 126299,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Jon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;athan&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Nulla, perché non c'è alcuna istruzione <code>print()</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>Jonathan</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Nulla, perché non c'è alcuna istruzione <code>print()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Updating a variable",
            "id": 126300,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Che cosa visualizza questo codice nella console?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" username = \" /><text value=\"&quot;snoopdogg&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Username: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + username)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Username: snoopdogg\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Username: snoopdogg</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>snoopdogg</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Username: snoopdogg</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Missing whitespace",
            "id": 126301,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Perché questo codice visualizza <code>SteveJobs</code> senza uno spazio nella console?</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Steve&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jobs&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"SteveJobs\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Perché <code>\"Steve\" + \"Jobs\"</code> somma i valori senza uno spazio</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Perché <code>print()</code> non visualizza mai gli spazi</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Perché <code>\"Steve\" + \"Jobs\"</code> somma i valori senza uno spazio.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
